[00:16.80]1. Nations are troubled as never before.
[00:23.32]People are fearful of what lies in store.
[00:29.66]Firm and immovable we need to be,
[00:35.66]Serving our God faithfully.
[00:38.66](Chorus)
[00:41.66]Steadfast we all need to be;
[00:48.96]Far from this world we keep free,
[00:55.20]Standing firm to the end,
[01:00.20]Unending life we’ll see.
[01:18.24]2. Snares of the world and temptations abound.
[01:24.24]We can resist if our thinking is sound.
[01:31.24]Hating what’s bad while we love what is true
[01:37.24]Makes us immovable too.
[01:40.70](Chorus)
[01:44.16]Steadfast we all need to be;
[01:50.64]Far from this world we keep free,
[01:57.06]Standing firm to the end,
[02:02.16]Unending life we’ll see.
[02:23.42]3. Give to God worship that comes from the heart.
[02:29.92]In the Lord’s service may we have a part.
[02:36.42]Preach the good news, always holding it fast.
[02:42.92]Soon the last days will have passed.
[02:47.79](Chorus)
[02:52.67]Steadfast we all need to be;
[02:57.54]Far from this world we keep free,
[03:02.42]Standing firm to the end,
[03:07.29]Unending life we’ll see.